# Copy to `.env` and fill in. Both variables are optional for a local run — the app builds
# and serves with neither set.
#
# `.env` is gitignored. Keep it that way: nothing in this repo needs a credential today, but
# the moment your fork adds one, the ignore is what stops it reaching a public commit.

# Google Analytics 4 measurement ID. Leave it EMPTY and analytics is fully inert: no script
# is loaded, no cookie is set, and the consent bar does not render at all. That is
# deliberate — the site's property is that nothing third-party loads until a reader says
# yes, and a build that measures nothing should not be asking permission to.
#
# A deployed fork sets this in CI, not here.
VITE_GA_MEASUREMENT_ID=

# The canonical origin, used to build absolute canonical / hreflang / OG URLs at build time.
# Defaults to https://tadeumendonca.io when unset. Set it if you are serving a fork from your
# own domain — otherwise your fork ships advertising this one's canonical URLs, which hands
# it your SEO and puts this site's card on your links.
VITE_SITE_URL=https://tadeumendonca.io
